      shell: base artistic face RGB * (Environment + (Solar*abs(N.Sun) + Lunar*abs(N.Moon))/pi).
      Native instance brightness/daylight/sunset and TextureCol do not supply incident illumination.
      The observer-based atmosphere remains the existing approximation, with no altitude-resolved
      incident solver. Aerial transport/lookup decoding and physical frame encoding each occur once.
